    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pitu is a  <strong>Singleplayer Card-Drafting Rogue-like Autobattler</strong> in a fallen world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture forth from the first settlement in an ancient land. Recruit adventurers, scavenge for equipment, and organize your party to overcome monstrous foes. Death is permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is automatic so take care placing you characters - the rest is up to fate. Draft the right cards for your party and keep them alive on their journey. Find safe havens to recover from battle and seek out new adventurers to bolster your ranks after death finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will meet and recruit adventurers to their party as they venture deeper into uncharted ancient lands. Each playthrough of Pitu will be a three-act sequence, but the second and third acts can change depending on your decisions. Make sure your party can handle anything!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pitu is a  <strong>Singleplayer Card-Drafting Rogue-like Autobattler</strong> in a fallen world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture forth from the first settlement in an ancient land. Recruit adventurers, scavenge for equipment, and organize your party to overcome monstrous foes. Death is permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is automatic so take care placing you characters - the rest is up to fate. Draft the right cards for your party and keep them alive on their journey. Find safe havens to recover from battle and seek out new adventurers to bolster your ranks after death finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will meet and recruit adventurers to their party as they venture deeper into uncharted ancient lands. Each playthrough of Pitu will be a three-act sequence, but the second and third acts can change depending on your decisions. Make sure your party can handle anything!</p>",
